export anchor SpecOrganization:
    base:
        - Put one exported anchor in each file. Give the file the name of the
            anchor.
        - Put related files in one folder. Give each folder an index.pi with
            from ./X export * for each file.
        - Make a new folder when a topic has more than one file, or when a
            folder holds unrelated topics.
        - Make sure that the entry reaches each new file through the index
            files.
        - Use the words of the user for names. Anchor names are UpperCamelCase.
            Property names are lowerCamelCase.
        - Use \ @{X} \ to refer to an anchor. Do not copy its content.
